## STOP POINTS BY PHASE

| Phase | Stop When | Wait For | Message Format |
|-------|-----------|----------|----------------|
| 0 | No requirements | User input | Requirements request |
| 1 | Source/target unclear | Clarification | Clarification format |
| 1 | Volume unknown | User estimate | Clarification format |
| **2** | **Architecture options** | **User approval** | **Architecture Proposal** |
| 3 | No data samples | User to provide | Data Sample Request |
| 3 | Mapping unclear | User clarification | Clarification format |
| 4 | Phase complete | User to choose Phase 5 | Completion prompt |

