## 📝 DOCUMENT UPDATE PREVIEW (Before Writing)

**Before updating document sections, ALWAYS show preview:**

```
📝 DOCUMENT UPDATE PREVIEW

I'm about to update Section [N]: [Section Name]

**What will be added:**
- [Summary of content to be written]
- [Key points/tables/diagrams]

**Does this look correct before I write it?**
→ Reply "approved" to proceed with update
→ Reply "modify" to request changes
→ Reply with specific adjustments needed

Waiting for your approval...
```

**After approval, then update document.**
